\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {34}{\ignorespaces Failure of Gaussian model fit for the $\setbox \z@ \hbox {\mathsurround \z@ $\textstyle A$}\mathaccent "0365{A}_{2B}^{\text {Re}}$ amplitude, with $\alpha -\beta = -0.0427(27)$ and $\chi ^2/\text {dof}\approx 235$.\relax }}{106}{figure.caption.46}%
